{"id":"00bfc1ab4d63fa50a26c385e29e976dbc67b29d0","url":"https://hub.baai.ac.cn/view/57939","title":"官宣！OpenAI关停史上最快模型 - 智源社区","site_name":"TopHub","source":"Readhub · AI","byline":"新智元\n                  2026-09-14 11:40 分享","excerpt":"OpenAI史上最快模型GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark将于下周退役，仅运行7个月。该模型每秒处理1200个Token，是OpenAI首个脱离英伟达芯片的模型，也是Cerebras 750兆瓦大单的首份交付成果。Codex负责人Tibo称退役主因是使用量持续下滑，且已有更优替代模型。他强调“是时候给未来腾地方了”，暗示技术迭代加速，旧模型迅速被取代。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><section id=\"js_content\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mtxjbr1p12db\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><section data-mpa-action-id=\"mtxjb0611pzn\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><h3 data-mpa-powered-by=\"yiban.io\"><section data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"88402\" data-style=\"line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0px; color: rgb(117, 114, 114);white-space: normal;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-backh=\"240\" data-backw=\"562\" data-imgfileid=\"505241558\" data-ratio=\"0.42643923240938164\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/60da2d83c487e902ac53af73c41526321789357202030.webp\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"2345\" type=\"block\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/60da2d83c487e902ac53af73c41526321789357202030.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section></h3><h3><section data-id=\"88402\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\"><p><span><strong><span><span leaf=\"\">&#160;&#160;</span></span></strong><strong><span><span leaf=\"\">新智元报道 &#160;</span></span></strong></span></p></section></h3><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><p><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/3b253ef41422b4d012484a3c9cacf4e71789357202031.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.06944444444444445\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"578\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"40\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"40\" data-imgfileid=\"505218218\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/3b253ef41422b4d012484a3c9cacf4e71789357202031.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></p></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f1x58\"><span textstyle=\"\">OpenAI史上最快的模型，死了。</span></span></section><section><span mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1fica\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">刚刚，Codex负责人Tibo发帖，</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark，下周退役。</span></span></strong></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f24sh\"><span textstyle=\"\">每秒1200个Token、OpenAI第一个逃离英伟达的模型、750兆瓦Cerebras大单的头一份交付，从发布到下线，只活了7个月。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f1ndp\"><span textstyle=\"\">Tibo给的理由很简单，用量一直在往下掉，手上也已经有明显更好的模型了。「是时候给未来腾地方了。」</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f7yc\"><span textstyle=\"\">然后，他又在底下补了一刀，「真不敢相信，我们居然发布过名字这么长的模型！！」</span></span></section><section data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;2b89288c-b849-4eaf-ad26-e9ce136914ff&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:232.54666666666668,&quot;width&quot;:428,&quot;currHeight&quot;:232.54666666666668,&quot;currWidth&quot;:428,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:652,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.3566666666666667,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Fapi3-eeft-drive.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FNPo5bdJIKotavjxswLccNXULnce%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;NPo5bdJIKotavjxswLccNXULnce&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:108655,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/49b921f60283187b00e3900da74cfd3d1789357202031.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5433333333333333\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1200\" data-width=\"1200\" data-height=\"652\" data-backw=\"546\" data-backh=\"297\" data-imgfileid=\"505241530\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/49b921f60283187b00e3900da74cfd3d1789357202031.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001789357202031.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5267857142857143\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"112\" data-imgfileid=\"505095291\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001789357202031.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">告别式上，大家只关心「备用额度」</span></strong></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f1kpi\"><span textstyle=\"\">Spark走得很安静，甚至显得有些尴尬。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1fcoj\"><span textstyle=\"\">Hugging Face的Vaibhav Srivastav试图在评论区留下一点温情。</span></span></section><section><p><span leaf=\"\">感谢服役，你很特别，希望你为自己是第一个「最快的小子」而骄傲。下周退役前，发条prompt吧，感受一下我们从那时到现在走了多远。</span></p></section><section data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;aef69fa3-92f8-4b6a-9073-d591317275ad&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:652,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:652,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:652,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Fapi3-eeft-drive.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FJfB1bfQrjoifrexqgHfc9DgLnZg%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;JfB1bfQrjoifrexqgHfc9DgLnZg&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:109656,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-backh=\"297\" data-backw=\"546\" data-height=\"652\" data-imgfileid=\"505241533\" data-ratio=\"0.5433333333333333\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/d4aada37b058c5fae03eaa3b7ad0f3161789357202031.webp\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1200\" data-width=\"1200\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/d4aada37b058c5fae03eaa3b7ad0f3161789357202031.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1fhej\"><span textstyle=\"\">紧随其后的热评，画风立刻变得犀利起来。</span></span></section><section><p><span leaf=\"\">所以它到底是干嘛用的？前两天我还在跟同事讨论这个问题。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI要退役Codex-Spark了，那仅存的67个重度用户该伤心了。</span></p></section><section data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;8c90f880-361b-4746-ac0f-bd822660811c&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:486,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:486,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:486,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Fapi3-eeft-drive.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FEfnjbZlVCoSQfVxQ5VAcJtGMnHh%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;EfnjbZlVCoSQfVxQ5VAcJtGMnHh&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:62204,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-backh=\"221\" data-backw=\"546\" data-height=\"486\" data-imgfileid=\"505241532\" data-ratio=\"0.405\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/9585dbf23b9896be63f95ea4418d42391789357202031.webp\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1200\" data-width=\"1200\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/9585dbf23b9896be63f95ea4418d42391789357202031.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section><span mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f12s5\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">更致命的评价来自开发者argofowl，</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">「Spark是个好玩的模型，也是个极度糟糕、根本没法用的模型。很高兴它走了，我好几个月没碰过了。」</span></span></strong></span></section><section data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;42565a66-f1b7-4fcf-a5ac-87144f0d72f6&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:706,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:706,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:706,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Fapi3-eeft-drive.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FTixxbpdlfoCi9gxhe3cccxbMn0e%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;TixxbpdlfoCi9gxhe3cccxbMn0e&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:76427,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/17b3a587cedf2b3afb2208032d67094b1789357202031.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5883333333333334\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1200\" data-width=\"1200\" data-height=\"706\" data-backw=\"546\" data-backh=\"321\" data-imgfileid=\"505241531\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/17b3a587cedf2b3afb2208032d67094b1789357202031.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f1udq\"><span textstyle=\"\">还有开发者表示，几个规模不小的项目里，他几乎没用过Spark，连理解项目上下文、分析日志这种基础任务，都会迅速把上下文窗口塞满，逼着他另开一个对话。</span></span></section><section><span mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f8kg\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">事实上，真正对Spark退役感到一丝惋惜的，惋惜的也并非模型本身，而是它附带的</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">独立配额</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f24b8\"><span textstyle=\"\">知名开发者Chubby坦言想要一个「GPT-6-Spark」，因为Spark拥有一份不占主额度的独立套餐。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f11n6\"><span textstyle=\"\">在Astra额度极其紧张的当下，很多开发者是把Spark当作主额度耗尽后的「备用油箱」来顶一阵子。</span></span></section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/c46c207d3a31d06744d3c3c03b6771da1789357202031.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.42674616695059625\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1174\" type=\"block\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"240\" data-imgfileid=\"505241547\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/c46c207d3a31d06744d3c3c03b6771da1789357202031.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001789357202031.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5267857142857143\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"112\" data-imgfileid=\"505095291\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001789357202031.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">7个月前的「未来」，败给了「降智提速」</span></strong></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f222m\"><span textstyle=\"\">把时间拨回今年2月12日，Spark上线那天的排场可谓盛大。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1fea0\"><span textstyle=\"\">这是OpenAI第一个专为实时编程设计的模型，128k上下文，每秒生成超过1000个Token。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f7h\"><span textstyle=\"\">按官方给的数字，客户端和服务器之间的往返开销降了80%，每个Token的处理开销降了30%，首Token延迟砍掉一半。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f1gx6\"><span textstyle=\"\">代码不再一行一行往外蹦，整块整块地倾泻在屏幕上。</span></span></section><section data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;75d96509-4dcf-4599-9b2f-1c7c96ae8c76&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:566,&quot;width&quot;:1007,&quot;currHeight&quot;:566,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1007,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:566,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1007,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Fapi3-eeft-drive.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FLrd7brxUfoVs00xH245czLF8n0c%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Lrd7brxUfoVs00xH245czLF8n0c&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:219440,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-backh=\"307\" data-backw=\"546\" data-height=\"566\" data-imgfileid=\"505241538\" data-ratio=\"0.5620655412115194\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/79c3cdb65ffa31f517947400705919f81789357202032.webp\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1007\" data-width=\"1007\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/79c3cdb65ffa31f517947400705919f81789357202032.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f4q1\"><span textstyle=\"\">最早一批上手的开发者，反应也是真的兴奋。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1ffxi\"><span textstyle=\"\">开发者Ryan Vogel直接把它编进了正式工作流，GPT-5.4负责规划，GPT-5.3-Codex负责构建，Spark负责探索代码库、查文档、给第二意见。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1fv7n\"><span textstyle=\"\">他说这是自己第一次工作流里一个Claude模型都没有，「效率更高，花得更少」。</span></span></section><section data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;88107542-7e69-4e54-8111-a25cd66ee550&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:812,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:812,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:812,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Fapi3-eeft-drive.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FGRNfbEWjJo5Un4xPcoNcetXEnqc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;GRNfbEWjJo5Un4xPcoNcetXEnqc&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:121634,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-backh=\"369\" data-backw=\"546\" data-height=\"812\" data-imgfileid=\"505241535\" data-ratio=\"0.6766666666666666\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/f457e00d4d587baa318f7087e802c6601789357202032.webp\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1200\" data-width=\"1200\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/f457e00d4d587baa318f7087e802c6601789357202032.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f19vj\"><span textstyle=\"\">Instructor作者Jason Liu，直接开20个Spark子代理去搜文件系统，宣布「RAG已死」。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1foox\"><span textstyle=\"\">然后，他就在不久之后加入了OpenAI的Codex团队。</span></span></section><section data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;0fb0c416-a293-4ca3-8fd1-d6fef53bd50a&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:440,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:440,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:440,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Fapi3-eeft-drive.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FXcXMbsYF7oBxRTxBMFTc7esznZb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;XcXMbsYF7oBxRTxBMFTc7esznZb&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:60466,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/5da4e58ad58310f2faeb4c56860fdc921789357202032.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.36666666666666664\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1200\" data-width=\"1200\" data-height=\"440\" data-backw=\"546\" data-backh=\"200\" data-imgfileid=\"505241534\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/5da4e58ad58310f2faeb4c56860fdc921789357202032.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f1n7u\"><span textstyle=\"\">更关键的是，Spark承载着OpenAI摆脱单一硬件依赖的野心。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f13lw\"><span textstyle=\"\">它是OpenAI第一个跑在英伟达技术栈之外的生产模型，底层算力来自初创公司Cerebras的晶圆级芯片WSE-3。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f21rh\"><span textstyle=\"\">它标志着OpenAI与Cerebras签下的那份750兆瓦、总价值超200亿美元算力大单，交出了第一份答卷。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1ftwk\"><span textstyle=\"\">但热度退得比涨得还要快。</span></span></section><section><span mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f1ny0\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">Spark的致命伤在于，</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">一块晶圆装不下旗舰模型，它本质上是一个为了极致速度而妥协的「蒸馏版小模型」。</span></span></strong></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f1uh3\"><span textstyle=\"\">在Terminal-Bench 2.0评测中，Spark仅获得58.4%的准确率，远低于完整版GPT-5.3-Codex的77.3%。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f1ja7\"><span textstyle=\"\">OpenAI自己放出的SWE-Bench Pro曲线也显示——Spark虽然能把任务时长压在1到2分钟，但准确率会停在47%到51%之间。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1fomx\"><span textstyle=\"\">相比之下，完整版GPT-5.3-Codex从3分钟起步就是51%，拉到9分钟是56%，16分钟能到57%。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f1su3\"><span textstyle=\"\">也就是说，Spark省下的那几分钟，换来的是往下掉五六个点。</span></span></section><section data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;2745a024-222c-4b8e-800f-273b62b5b9fe&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:669,&quot;width&quot;:893,&quot;currHeight&quot;:669,&quot;currWidth&quot;:893,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:669,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:893,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Fapi3-eeft-drive.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FWCLfb8JBXoUJF3x26l2cyOcKnKb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;WCLfb8JBXoUJF3x26l2cyOcKnKb&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:92542,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/7ebb89c923e3b6cab61623c71db214441789357202032.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.7491601343784995\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"893\" data-width=\"893\" data-height=\"669\" data-backw=\"546\" data-backh=\"409\" data-imgfileid=\"505241537\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/7ebb89c923e3b6cab61623c71db214441789357202032.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f1erq\"><span textstyle=\"\">宣传中的「15倍提速」也被拆穿了。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f1iy1\"><span textstyle=\"\">发布第二天，开发者Nicholas Van Landschoot就在X上发了篇长文，把OpenAI的对比条件扒了一遍，所谓15倍，是拿Spark去比开了最高推理强度的GPT-5.3-Codex。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f1gnf\"><span textstyle=\"\">在同等准确率下，Spark其实只快了1.37倍。</span></span></section><section data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;2c48dd7c-b319-445b-8847-672c4020908c&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:812,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:812,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:812,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Fapi3-eeft-drive.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FVwmbbI46JoGLrgxubPMcEkv9n9b%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;VwmbbI46JoGLrgxubPMcEkv9n9b&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:143941,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-backh=\"369\" data-backw=\"546\" data-height=\"812\" data-imgfileid=\"505241536\" data-ratio=\"0.6766666666666666\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/ebb533f4a6966a25bb7e403394fb8f5d1789357202032.webp\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1200\" data-width=\"1200\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/ebb533f4a6966a25bb7e403394fb8f5d1789357202032.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1fvxr\"><span textstyle=\"\">在实际编码场景中，它的缺陷被无限放大，凭空捏造API端点，JSON格式不稳定，多步任务极易跑偏。</span></span></section><section><span mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1fq1q\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">培训机构Turing College对它的总结一针见血，</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">「没有智能的速度，只是更快地失败。」</span></span></strong></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f1r34\"><span textstyle=\"\">对于程序员而言，花17分钟等一个能跑通的代码，永远比花2分钟拿一个全是Bug的废品要划算。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f19yx\"><span textstyle=\"\">于是，这款主打速度的模型，注定走向边缘化。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001789357202032.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5267857142857143\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"112\" data-imgfileid=\"505095291\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001789357202032.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">旗舰本尊下场，Ultrafast终结了Spark</span></strong></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f16bw\"><span textstyle=\"\">而真正给Spark宣判死刑的，是8月13日Cerebras发布的Ultrafast模式。</span></span></section><section><span mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f1vf0\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">这一次，跑在晶圆上的不再是缩水版的Spark，而是旗舰模型</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">GPT-5.6 Sol本尊</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></span></section><section nodeleaf=\"\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mtxjmiucm6l\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/6f45ab6aa3e5d4d8a4b69ebea433e5b81789357202032.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.6868953386103782\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1137\" height=\"239\" type=\"block\" width=\"462\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"386\" data-imgfileid=\"505241550\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/6f45ab6aa3e5d4d8a4b69ebea433e5b81789357202032.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f21un\"><span textstyle=\"\">通过将庞大的旗舰模型按层切分，铺设在多台CS-3节点上形成流水线，Ultrafast模式在保证「与标准版同等智能」的前提下，飙出了每秒750个Token的恐怖速度。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f1wpw\"><span textstyle=\"\">Cerebras给的对比是，Ultrafast比标准档快14倍，中间还有一档Priority，只快2.5倍。</span></span></section><section data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;1014eb46-f7ee-44da-a8e2-7d2c190df019&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:718,&quot;width&quot;:1007,&quot;currHeight&quot;:718,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1007,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:718,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1007,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Fapi3-eeft-drive.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FArz8bvgPCoLqhYx1osqcGDi3nOd%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Arz8bvgPCoLqhYx1osqcGDi3nOd&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:118290,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/135b863eb895cfbc52cece53929cb7b51789357202032.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.7130089374379345\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1007\" data-width=\"1007\" data-height=\"718\" data-backw=\"546\" data-backh=\"389\" data-imgfileid=\"505241540\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/135b863eb895cfbc52cece53929cb7b51789357202032.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section><span mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f1wyu\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">Cerebras CEO Andrew Feldman对此的评价掷地有声，</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">「速度与智能，不再互斥。」</span></span></strong></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f1hed\"><span textstyle=\"\">他们拿GDP-Val里6个质量对齐的任务做了一组耗时对比。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1fo6p\"><span textstyle=\"\">标准档Sol平均要跑7.7分钟，其中7.5分钟花在模型生成上。换到Ultrafast，同样的任务总共83秒，模型生成68秒，剩下的15秒是工具调用之类的非推理开销。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1fx53\"><span textstyle=\"\">也就是说，端到端快了整整5.6倍，而且回答的质量也几乎没有差别。</span></span></section><section data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;820b3230-d11f-49ad-9360-3df1580c782e&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:430,&quot;width&quot;:1007,&quot;currHeight&quot;:430,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1007,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:430,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1007,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Fapi3-eeft-drive.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FRHwLbXdAko6orKxVEPocS8pGnM9%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;RHwLbXdAko6orKxVEPocS8pGnM9&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:124025,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/63032ca9676551133b0458824818666e1789357202032.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.4270109235352532\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1007\" data-width=\"1007\" data-height=\"430\" data-imgfileid=\"505241539\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/63032ca9676551133b0458824818666e1789357202032.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f1j17\"><span textstyle=\"\">这句话不仅宣告了技术突破，也直接抽干了Spark存在的全部意义。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1fv3z\"><span textstyle=\"\">Spark的设计初衷就是「拿智能换速度」，而仅仅半年后，同一家公司的晶圆上已经能跑完整的旗舰模型，速度只慢了四分之一，能力却一分没少。</span></span></section><section data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;5dd404e4-12d4-4c5b-8a55-c6c833d6d550&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:720,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:720,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:720,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Fapi3-eeft-drive.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FSeNubFDMJorW8UxOYHCcvAqCnjc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;SeNubFDMJorW8UxOYHCcvAqCnjc&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/gif&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1829379,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-backh=\"328\" data-backw=\"546\" data-height=\"720\" data-imgfileid=\"505241543\" data-ratio=\"0.6\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/a08e3f095ef464783be57bcb526af3a81789357202033.webp\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"1200\" data-width=\"1200\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/a08e3f095ef464783be57bcb526af3a81789357202033.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f1ris\"><span textstyle=\"\">Cerebras的产能是有限的。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1fv33\"><span textstyle=\"\">当无人问津的「缩小版」和排队疯抢的「旗舰版」挤在同一批晶圆上时，谁该为未来腾地方，答案不言而喻。</span></span></section><section data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;09d9130a-bb27-40b6-835c-64c55876e438&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:528,&quot;width&quot;:1007,&quot;currHeight&quot;:528,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1007,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:528,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1007,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Fapi3-eeft-drive.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FOOcTbxrh7oZFzaxm80nchEARnAd%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;OOcTbxrh7oZFzaxm80nchEARnAd&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:272072,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-backh=\"286\" data-backw=\"546\" data-height=\"528\" data-imgfileid=\"505241541\" data-ratio=\"0.5243296921549155\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/f434818a2f367e84a20fb0d5f8d89f251789357202033.webp\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1007\" data-width=\"1007\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/f434818a2f367e84a20fb0d5f8d89f251789357202033.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001789357202033.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5267857142857143\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"112\" data-imgfileid=\"505095291\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001789357202033.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">速度不再是「专属模型」，而是「付费档位」</span></strong></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f1zel\"><span textstyle=\"\">Spark并非唯一被清理的历史包袱。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f12eb\"><span textstyle=\"\">过去三个月里，OpenAI的模型库正在经历一场激进的「大换血」。</span></span></section><ul><li><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1fhxz\"><span textstyle=\"\">6月2日，GPT-5.2与GPT-5.3-Codex退役。</span></span></section></li><li><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f1ub2\"><span textstyle=\"\">8月31日，GPT-5.4与5.4 Mini退役，用户整体迁移至5.6世代。</span></span></section></li><li><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f10vf\"><span textstyle=\"\">9月11日，轮到GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark。</span></span></section></li></ul><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f1oxx\"><span textstyle=\"\">伴随着旧世代的离场，Codex迎来了Sol（太阳）、Terra（大地）、Luna（月亮）、Astra（星辰）的全新命名纪元。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1fd3p\"><span textstyle=\"\">「GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark」这种带有冗长版本号和产品线后缀的名字，确实已经像上一个时代的遗迹。</span></span></section><section nodeleaf=\"\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mtxjj48vw4u\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/baad5ab27793177ca6309e35584137591789357202033.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.7633333333333333\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"2400\" height=\"1560\" width=\"1354\" data-width=\"2400\" data-height=\"1832\" data-backw=\"546\" data-backh=\"629\" data-imgfileid=\"505241542\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/baad5ab27793177ca6309e35584137591789357202033.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section><span mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f1qub\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">更深层的逻辑更迭在于，</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">「快」这一属性，正在从一个独立的专用模型，演变为旗舰模型的一项标配「档位」。</span></span></strong></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f2d2\"><span textstyle=\"\">就像推理强度分为Light到Max一样，OpenAI现在的速度也从Standard、Priority排到了Ultrafast。速度与算力挂钩，按档付费的商业模式已经彻底跑通。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1ff5b\"><span textstyle=\"\">回头再看，Spark完美地完成了它的历史使命。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f23mg\"><span textstyle=\"\">它作为一个过渡期的探路者，证明了Cerebras的晶圆足以扛住生成式AI的生产级流量，也证明了推理任务完全可以脱离英伟达的生态运行。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f1xao\"><span textstyle=\"\">当探路结束，大部队正式入驻，探路者的使命也就自然终结了。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f18yg\"><span textstyle=\"\">「拿智能换速度」的歧途在今天被正式封死。</span></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1fhjl\"><span textstyle=\"\">随着各大平台开始竞逐底层硬件的极致利用率，下一轮的军备竞赛规则已经彻底改写。</span></span></section><section><span mpa-font-style=\"mtxjbr1f1jqv\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">接下来要比的不再是谁能做出最快的阉割版模型，而是</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">谁能把最强的旗舰模型，跑出最极限的速度。</span></span></strong></span></section><p><span><span leaf=\"\">参考资料：</span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></span></p><p><span><span leaf=\"\">https://x.com/thsottiaux/status/2098300998968357218</span></span></p><p><span><span leaf=\"\">编辑：摩西</span></span></p><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">秒追ASI</span></strong></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">⭐</span></strong><strong><span leaf=\"\">点赞、转发、在看一键三连</span></strong><strong><span leaf=\"\">⭐</span></strong></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">点亮星标，锁定新智元极速推送！</span></strong></span></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/4d80689a0a4e5d39176224ba829acc3e1789357202033.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.2111111111111111\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"122\" data-imgfileid=\"505133683\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/4d80689a0a4e5d39176224ba829acc3e1789357202033.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></p><section><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-backh=\"355\" data-backw=\"578\" data-imgfileid=\"505229036\" data-ratio=\"0.6129629629629629\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/50d0834dc7435040000e52c792d62ad01789357202033.webp\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/50d0834dc7435040000e52c792d62ad01789357202033.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></section></section><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mtxjb061229o\"></span></section></DIV>","content_text":"新智元报道 OpenAI史上最快的模型，死了。刚刚，Codex负责人Tibo发帖，GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark，下周退役。每秒1200个Token、OpenAI第一个逃离英伟达的模型、750兆瓦Cerebras大单的头一份交付，从发布到下线，只活了7个月。Tibo给的理由很简单，用量一直在往下掉，手上也已经有明显更好的模型了。「是时候给未来腾地方了。」然后，他又在底下补了一刀，「真不敢相信，我们居然发布过名字这么长的模型！！」告别式上，大家只关心「备用额度」Spark走得很安静，甚至显得有些尴尬。Hugging Face的Vaibhav Srivastav试图在评论区留下一点温情。感谢服役，你很特别，希望你为自己是第一个「最快的小子」而骄傲。下周退役前，发条prompt吧，感受一下我们从那时到现在走了多远。紧随其后的热评，画风立刻变得犀利起来。所以它到底是干嘛用的？前两天我还在跟同事讨论这个问题。OpenAI要退役Codex-Spark了，那仅存的67个重度用户该伤心了。更致命的评价来自开发者argofowl，「Spark是个好玩的模型，也是个极度糟糕、根本没法用的模型。很高兴它走了，我好几个月没碰过了。」还有开发者表示，几个规模不小的项目里，他几乎没用过Spark，连理解项目上下文、分析日志这种基础任务，都会迅速把上下文窗口塞满，逼着他另开一个对话。事实上，真正对Spark退役感到一丝惋惜的，惋惜的也并非模型本身，而是它附带的独立配额。知名开发者Chubby坦言想要一个「GPT-6-Spark」，因为Spark拥有一份不占主额度的独立套餐。在Astra额度极其紧张的当下，很多开发者是把Spark当作主额度耗尽后的「备用油箱」来顶一阵子。7个月前的「未来」，败给了「降智提速」把时间拨回今年2月12日，Spark上线那天的排场可谓盛大。这是OpenAI第一个专为实时编程设计的模型，128k上下文，每秒生成超过1000个Token。按官方给的数字，客户端和服务器之间的往返开销降了80%，每个Token的处理开销降了30%，首Token延迟砍掉一半。代码不再一行一行往外蹦，整块整块地倾泻在屏幕上。最早一批上手的开发者，反应也是真的兴奋。开发者Ryan Vogel直接把它编进了正式工作流，GPT-5.4负责规划，GPT-5.3-Codex负责构建，Spark负责探索代码库、查文档、给第二意见。他说这是自己第一次工作流里一个Claude模型都没有，「效率更高，花得更少」。Instructor作者Jason Liu，直接开20个Spark子代理去搜文件系统，宣布「RAG已死」。然后，他就在不久之后加入了OpenAI的Codex团队。更关键的是，Spark承载着OpenAI摆脱单一硬件依赖的野心。它是OpenAI第一个跑在英伟达技术栈之外的生产模型，底层算力来自初创公司Cerebras的晶圆级芯片WSE-3。它标志着OpenAI与Cerebras签下的那份750兆瓦、总价值超200亿美元算力大单，交出了第一份答卷。但热度退得比涨得还要快。Spark的致命伤在于，一块晶圆装不下旗舰模型，它本质上是一个为了极致速度而妥协的「蒸馏版小模型」。在Terminal-Bench 2.0评测中，Spark仅获得58.4%的准确率，远低于完整版GPT-5.3-Codex的77.3%。OpenAI自己放出的SWE-Bench Pro曲线也显示——Spark虽然能把任务时长压在1到2分钟，但准确率会停在47%到51%之间。相比之下，完整版GPT-5.3-Codex从3分钟起步就是51%，拉到9分钟是56%，16分钟能到57%。也就是说，Spark省下的那几分钟，换来的是往下掉五六个点。宣传中的「15倍提速」也被拆穿了。发布第二天，开发者Nicholas Van Landschoot就在X上发了篇长文，把OpenAI的对比条件扒了一遍，所谓15倍，是拿Spark去比开了最高推理强度的GPT-5.3-Codex。在同等准确率下，Spark其实只快了1.37倍。在实际编码场景中，它的缺陷被无限放大，凭空捏造API端点，JSON格式不稳定，多步任务极易跑偏。培训机构Turing College对它的总结一针见血，「没有智能的速度，只是更快地失败。」对于程序员而言，花17分钟等一个能跑通的代码，永远比花2分钟拿一个全是Bug的废品要划算。于是，这款主打速度的模型，注定走向边缘化。旗舰本尊下场，Ultrafast终结了Spark而真正给Spark宣判死刑的，是8月13日Cerebras发布的Ultrafast模式。这一次，跑在晶圆上的不再是缩水版的Spark，而是旗舰模型GPT-5.6 Sol本尊。通过将庞大的旗舰模型按层切分，铺设在多台CS-3节点上形成流水线，Ultrafast模式在保证「与标准版同等智能」的前提下，飙出了每秒750个Token的恐怖速度。Cerebras给的对比是，Ultrafast比标准档快14倍，中间还有一档Priority，只快2.5倍。Cerebras CEO Andrew Feldman对此的评价掷地有声，「速度与智能，不再互斥。」他们拿GDP-Val里6个质量对齐的任务做了一组耗时对比。标准档Sol平均要跑7.7分钟，其中7.5分钟花在模型生成上。换到Ultrafast，同样的任务总共83秒，模型生成68秒，剩下的15秒是工具调用之类的非推理开销。也就是说，端到端快了整整5.6倍，而且回答的质量也几乎没有差别。这句话不仅宣告了技术突破，也直接抽干了Spark存在的全部意义。Spark的设计初衷就是「拿智能换速度」，而仅仅半年后，同一家公司的晶圆上已经能跑完整的旗舰模型，速度只慢了四分之一，能力却一分没少。Cerebras的产能是有限的。当无人问津的「缩小版」和排队疯抢的「旗舰版」挤在同一批晶圆上时，谁该为未来腾地方，答案不言而喻。速度不再是「专属模型」，而是「付费档位」Spark并非唯一被清理的历史包袱。过去三个月里，OpenAI的模型库正在经历一场激进的「大换血」。6月2日，GPT-5.2与GPT-5.3-Codex退役。8月31日，GPT-5.4与5.4 Mini退役，用户整体迁移至5.6世代。9月11日，轮到GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark。伴随着旧世代的离场，Codex迎来了Sol（太阳）、Terra（大地）、Luna（月亮）、Astra（星辰）的全新命名纪元。「GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark」这种带有冗长版本号和产品线后缀的名字，确实已经像上一个时代的遗迹。更深层的逻辑更迭在于，「快」这一属性，正在从一个独立的专用模型，演变为旗舰模型的一项标配「档位」。就像推理强度分为Light到Max一样，OpenAI现在的速度也从Standard、Priority排到了Ultrafast。速度与算力挂钩，按档付费的商业模式已经彻底跑通。回头再看，Spark完美地完成了它的历史使命。它作为一个过渡期的探路者，证明了Cerebras的晶圆足以扛住生成式AI的生产级流量，也证明了推理任务完全可以脱离英伟达的生态运行。当探路结束，大部队正式入驻，探路者的使命也就自然终结了。「拿智能换速度」的歧途在今天被正式封死。随着各大平台开始竞逐底层硬件的极致利用率，下一轮的军备竞赛规则已经彻底改写。接下来要比的不再是谁能做出最快的阉割版模型，而是谁能把最强的旗舰模型，跑出最极限的速度。参考资料：https://x.com/thsottiaux/status/2098300998968357218编辑：摩西秒追ASI⭐点赞、转发、在看一键三连⭐点亮星标，锁定新智元极速推送！","fetched_at":"2026-09-15T08:16:34.287Z","ok":true}